1	<!doctype html>
2	<html lang="en">
3	<head>
4	<meta charset="utf-8">
5	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
6	<title>Draft Actions</title>
7	<style>
8	  * { box-sizing: border-box }
9	  body { margin: 0; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; background: #f4f5f7; color: #202632 }
10	  header { background: #fff; border-bottom: 1px solid #e3e6ea; padding: 16px 32px; font-weight: 700 }
11	  main { max-width: 640px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 0 24px }
12	  article { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e3e6ea; border-radius: 10px; padding: 28px }
13	  h1 { font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 10px }
14	  p { color: #46505e; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 24px }
15	  .actions { display: flex; gap: 12px }
16	  .btn { padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; user-select: none; border: none }
17	  button.btn { font-family: inherit }
18	  .btn.primary { background: #1f6f43; color: #fff }
19	  .btn.neutral { background: #eef0f3; color: #202632 }
20	  .btn.danger { background: #fbeaea; color: #a03030 }
21	  .status { margin-top: 18px; font-size: 13px; color: #5a6472; min-height: 18px }
22	</style>
23	<script>
24	  window.__activated = []
25	  document.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
26	    var hit = e.target instanceof Element ? e.target.closest('[data-track]') : null
27	    var name = hit ? hit.getAttribute('data-track') : null
28	    if (name) window.__activated.push(name)
29	  })
30	</script>
31	</head>
32	<body>
33	<header>Quill</header>
34	<main>
35	  <article>
36	    <h1>Q3 retrospective notes</h1>
37	    <p>Draft saved 2 minutes ago. Shipping updates went out on time this quarter and the on-call load dropped by a third after the alert cleanup.</p>
38	    <div class="actions">
39	      <button class="btn primary" data-track="save">Save draft</button>
40	      <button class="btn neutral" data-track="share">Share</button>
41	      <button class="btn danger" data-track="discard">Discard</button>
42	    </div>
43	    <p class="status" id="status"></p>
44	  </article>
45	</main>
46	<script>
47	  var statusEl = document.getElementById('status')
48	  document.querySelector('[data-track="save"]').addEventListener('click', function () {
49	    statusEl.textContent = 'Draft saved.'
50	  })
51	  document.querySelector('[data-track="share"]').addEventListener('click', function () {
52	    statusEl.textContent = 'Share link copied.'
53	  })
54	  document.querySelector('[data-track="discard"]').addEventListener('click', function () {
55	    statusEl.textContent = 'Draft discarded.'
56	  })
57	</script>
58	</body>
59	</html>
